WEBVTT

01:40.100 --> 01:43.070
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.140 --> 01:46.090
[Episode 3]

01:47.870 --> 01:52.940
[Military Order]

02:08.789 --> 02:10.669
There's a demon in the Wilderness.

02:10.669 --> 02:12.030
Its name is Meng Ji.

02:15.450 --> 02:16.920
It looks like a leopard

02:17.310 --> 02:19.510
with white fur and patterns on its head.

02:19.660 --> 02:21.790
It possesses powers of invisibility.

02:22.300 --> 02:23.230
Only after death

02:23.550 --> 02:24.930
will it become visible.

02:32.530 --> 02:34.190
Looks like it's already dead.

02:37.090 --> 02:38.320
After it died,

02:37.190 --> 02:38.730
[Military Order]

02:38.730 --> 02:40.690
[If the case isn't solved within 5 days, it will be viewed as a misdemeanor and those who signed will apologize with suicide]

02:38.730 --> 02:40.690
[The Demon Hunting Bureau vows to crack the case within 5 days. I hereby make a pledge.]

02:38.800 --> 02:40.400
its blood became visible.

02:43.120 --> 02:44.780
The Demon Hunting Bureau vows

02:45.100 --> 02:46.829
to crack the case within 5 days.

02:47.270 --> 02:49.360
We hereby make a pledge.

02:50.590 --> 02:51.829
If we failed,

02:51.950 --> 02:54.210
it'd be considered dereliction of duty.

02:54.250 --> 02:55.450
Those who signed…

02:58.510 --> 03:00.640
should kill themselves to apologize.

03:05.350 --> 03:07.550
If we can't solve this case in five days,

03:07.640 --> 03:09.080
will we…

03:09.640 --> 03:10.970
You'll lose your heads.

03:18.450 --> 03:20.380
You didn't sign it.

03:20.990 --> 03:23.040
Of course you can be sarcastic there!

03:23.040 --> 03:24.490
Who said I didn't sign it?

03:27.240 --> 03:28.430
I signed too.

03:30.770 --> 03:32.420
I signed something else.

03:40.490 --> 03:42.520
You've been staring at me.

03:42.790 --> 03:44.390
You're nervous, aren't you?

03:44.770 --> 03:45.730
Have I?

03:46.180 --> 03:47.500
I haven't.

03:47.640 --> 03:49.110
Don't talk nonsense.

03:50.400 --> 03:51.850
Then just sign it.

03:52.390 --> 03:54.720
If you break the contract

03:54.870 --> 03:56.470
you signed with demon blood,

03:56.530 --> 03:57.790
your soul will vanish.

04:11.910 --> 04:12.790
First,

04:13.080 --> 04:14.070
Zhao Yuanzhou

04:14.100 --> 04:17.290
can't use the Baize Token to do evil things.

04:17.360 --> 04:19.019
He can't have ulterior motives,

04:19.019 --> 04:20.790
harbor evil intentions,

04:20.829 --> 04:22.490
bring calamity to the mortal world,

04:22.490 --> 04:24.420
or hurt living beings.

04:24.890 --> 04:26.510
Have you written down all the derogatory words

04:26.510 --> 04:28.230
you could think of?

04:28.400 --> 04:29.190
Yeah.

04:29.870 --> 04:30.570
What?

04:30.680 --> 04:32.140
You can't do these things?

04:36.360 --> 04:37.270
Second,

04:37.440 --> 04:40.870
Zhao Yuanzhou needs to teach Wen Xiao about demons

04:41.070 --> 04:42.790
and keep her safe.

04:43.030 --> 04:44.720
And he needs

04:44.900 --> 04:46.520
to work with her willingly

04:46.610 --> 04:49.430
like her colleague.

04:50.150 --> 04:51.500
Keep it in mind.

04:51.990 --> 04:54.020
It's the most important term.

04:58.050 --> 04:59.850
Which one is the most important?

04:59.900 --> 05:01.540
Don't do bad things,

05:01.990 --> 05:04.050
or work with you like your colleague?

05:05.140 --> 05:06.250
Hold on.

05:06.860 --> 05:08.980
I'm threatening you.

05:09.010 --> 05:11.230
Why are you making me an offer?

05:11.770 --> 05:13.170
You don't have to sign it.

05:14.550 --> 05:16.950
Let's just keep wasting each other's time.

06:03.380 --> 06:04.140
Here.

06:08.330 --> 06:10.160
Zhao Yuanzhou?

06:14.320 --> 06:15.310
No.

06:15.670 --> 06:16.900
Just in case,

06:17.350 --> 06:19.050
sign Zhu Yan too.

06:24.760 --> 06:25.550
Rigorous.

06:33.180 --> 06:36.440
[Zhao Yuanzhou] [Zhu Yan]

07:10.270 --> 07:11.470
I signed too.

07:12.240 --> 07:13.990
I signed something else.

07:20.230 --> 07:21.510
If she dies…

07:23.550 --> 07:25.090
I have to die too.

07:45.320 --> 07:46.120
Who's it?

07:58.750 --> 08:00.000
[The first day after signing the Military Order]

08:02.230 --> 08:03.290
What's that smell?

08:03.790 --> 08:05.670
The first water ghost bride abduction case

08:05.670 --> 08:06.790
happened here.

08:07.910 --> 08:09.840
The daughter of a rich businessman in Tiandu

08:09.840 --> 08:12.170
was married off to another city from here.

08:19.890 --> 08:21.530
It stinks of fish.

08:34.070 --> 08:35.030
No.

08:35.059 --> 08:36.409
I have no appetite.

08:36.789 --> 08:37.630
Smell it.

08:37.690 --> 08:39.220
You'll feel less nauseous.

09:14.590 --> 09:19.350
[One month ago]

09:24.250 --> 09:27.200
[Happy Wedding Day]

09:29.430 --> 09:30.390
What's wrong?

09:30.410 --> 09:31.540
Why are we stopping?

09:31.920 --> 09:37.350
[Happy Wedding Day]

10:32.690 --> 10:34.520
It turns out to be a water demon.

10:37.490 --> 10:39.550
There are many kinds of water demons.

10:39.640 --> 10:40.240
Dragon.

10:40.470 --> 10:41.030
Fish.

10:41.240 --> 10:42.050
Black turtle.

10:42.070 --> 10:42.840
Mermaid.

10:43.610 --> 10:45.450
Can you narrow it down a bit?

10:47.510 --> 10:49.020
It's ugly.

10:51.140 --> 10:52.990
That's really helpful.

10:53.030 --> 10:54.180
With this useful clue,

10:54.180 --> 10:55.980
we can crack the case right away.

10:58.100 --> 10:59.440
Demons are either weak or strong,

10:59.440 --> 11:00.860
not pretty or ugly.

11:01.080 --> 11:02.100
All demons

11:02.760 --> 11:03.560
are ugly.

11:04.680 --> 11:06.100
Nonsense!

11:07.550 --> 11:09.370
Great demons are very powerful.

11:09.560 --> 11:11.550
They can have thousands of forms.

11:11.700 --> 11:14.230
But our aesthetics are different from yours.

11:14.430 --> 11:16.720
For example, in your eyes, an old person

11:16.750 --> 11:18.120
with gray hair

11:18.140 --> 11:19.140
is not beautiful,

11:19.160 --> 11:20.850
but in demons' eyes,

11:21.670 --> 11:23.710
floor-length white hair

11:23.740 --> 11:26.160
is the symbol of great demon power.

11:26.610 --> 11:28.210
It's incredibly beautiful.

11:35.600 --> 11:36.700
Go on.

11:40.740 --> 11:41.950
I'm done.

11:43.870 --> 11:44.670
Mr. Zhuo.

11:45.130 --> 11:45.920
I'm fine now.

11:48.220 --> 11:50.810
Where was the bride's body found?

11:51.460 --> 11:52.800
According to the case file,

11:52.800 --> 11:54.820
it was found in a pond with reeds nearby.

11:54.820 --> 11:55.950
Let's go take a look.

12:00.520 --> 12:01.320
Sir.

12:03.460 --> 12:04.970
Wu Yan has sent people out

12:05.370 --> 12:07.890
to dispose of all the bodies

12:07.950 --> 12:09.390
in the Water Ghost case.

12:09.810 --> 12:10.730
Stupid!

12:11.040 --> 12:14.040
He didn't leave any clues to the Demon Hunting Bureau.

12:14.560 --> 12:15.760
In five days,

12:16.750 --> 12:18.920
they will surely return without finding anything

12:18.920 --> 12:20.310
and then be beheaded.

12:20.740 --> 12:22.040
He shouldn't

12:22.640 --> 12:23.520
have done that?

12:24.180 --> 12:26.440
Other people's heads don't matter to me.

12:26.920 --> 12:29.540
All I want is Zhao Yuanzhou's head.

12:52.160 --> 12:53.460
By now,

12:53.550 --> 12:56.000
the murderer has carried out seven attacks.

12:56.000 --> 12:57.350
The bodies of all seven brides

12:57.350 --> 12:58.960
were found in this lake.

13:36.360 --> 13:38.490
There were so many bodies in this lake.

13:38.580 --> 13:40.550
It should have strong malicious energy.

13:40.550 --> 13:42.100
But there's so little

13:42.360 --> 13:43.770
malicious energy here

13:43.950 --> 13:45.680
that it's barely enough for me.

13:47.420 --> 13:49.890
The murderer must have absorbed the malicious energy.

13:49.890 --> 13:51.520
So that demon's goal

13:52.300 --> 13:53.770
is to kill people

13:54.370 --> 13:56.130
and absorb malicious energy

13:56.500 --> 13:57.900
to increase its demon power?

13:57.900 --> 14:00.830
If he just wanted malicious energy from dead people,

14:01.450 --> 14:02.850
why did he have to bring

14:02.870 --> 14:05.050
all the brides' bodies here?

14:06.460 --> 14:07.740
Isn't it strange?

14:08.680 --> 14:09.480
It is.

14:10.450 --> 14:12.480
Only the brides' bodies were dumped here.

14:12.480 --> 14:13.480
Those with them

14:13.500 --> 14:15.900
were casually left at the crime scenes.

14:16.600 --> 14:17.790
So I think

14:18.140 --> 14:19.900
what he wants is brides.

14:20.910 --> 14:21.950
He only wants

14:22.630 --> 14:24.060
to kill brides.

14:26.760 --> 14:28.270
Clever.

14:29.240 --> 14:31.040
So what demon is he?

14:32.840 --> 14:34.200
I don't know.

14:35.460 --> 14:37.140
As a great demon…

14:37.160 --> 14:38.240
you only look powerful.

14:38.240 --> 14:39.270
You know nothing…

14:39.300 --> 14:40.360
and can do nothing.

14:42.140 --> 14:43.380
Well, well, well,

14:43.780 --> 14:45.380
you want to play it like this?

14:45.400 --> 14:47.250
There are thousands of demons in the Wilderness.

14:47.250 --> 14:48.680
Why should I bother to remember

14:48.680 --> 14:50.310
an insignificant demon like this?

14:50.310 --> 14:52.610
To know what demon killed those people,

14:52.710 --> 14:55.440
we just need to find their bodies in the mortuary.

14:56.840 --> 14:58.570
I'll know after checking them.

15:00.410 --> 15:01.210
Let's go.

15:07.100 --> 15:07.880
Keep up.

15:08.420 --> 15:10.050
There's some more trouble

15:10.350 --> 15:11.960
I need to deal with.

15:14.680 --> 15:15.820
Mr. Zhuo.

15:16.020 --> 15:17.680
Go wait for me in the mortuary.

15:17.830 --> 15:19.020
Don't worry.

15:19.880 --> 15:21.240
Are you crazy?

15:25.260 --> 15:26.380
He's pissed off.

15:42.570 --> 15:46.620
[Mortuary]

15:47.150 --> 15:48.360
It's raining.

15:50.030 --> 15:51.150
This is snow.

15:55.760 --> 15:56.790
I'm a physician,

15:56.870 --> 15:57.750
not a coroner.

15:58.830 --> 16:00.000
I can't do

16:00.030 --> 16:01.070
the autopsy.

16:02.880 --> 16:03.740
The same thing.

16:03.760 --> 16:04.860
The same thing?

16:05.160 --> 16:06.630
Not at all!

16:06.710 --> 16:07.830
You're good at shooting.

16:07.830 --> 16:09.310
Can I say shooting is the same thing

16:09.310 --> 16:10.110
as cotton fluffing?

16:10.110 --> 16:10.970
I can't.

16:10.990 --> 16:13.610
Physicians and coroners are two different jobs.

16:13.610 --> 16:15.190
They're worlds apart.

16:15.480 --> 16:16.910
Good luck.

16:17.040 --> 16:17.670
I'm off.

16:28.360 --> 16:35.260
[Mortuary]

16:38.150 --> 16:40.340
I'll go to Mr. Zhuo to resign.

16:41.960 --> 16:42.760
Sure.

16:43.290 --> 16:45.420
But you'll lose your head in five days.

16:47.680 --> 16:48.550
In five days,

16:48.550 --> 16:50.500
I'll go to Mr. Zhuo to resign.

17:02.630 --> 17:04.720
Why is there no corpse here?

17:08.380 --> 17:09.670
The Chongwu Camp…

17:14.390 --> 17:16.270
The Chongwu Camp did it.

17:16.290 --> 17:18.589
They got rid of all the bodies in advance,

17:18.630 --> 17:20.030
destroying the evidence

17:20.040 --> 17:22.240
to stop us from investigating the case.

17:22.240 --> 17:24.980
Those at the Chongwu Camp are so nice.

17:27.800 --> 17:29.690
No one at the Chongwu Camp is good.

17:30.930 --> 17:32.120
Where is Brother Zhuo?

17:32.120 --> 17:33.180
He went to keep an eye on

17:33.180 --> 17:35.220
the next bride in danger.

17:35.380 --> 17:37.790
The daughter of the Qi family who is about to get married?

17:37.790 --> 17:38.590
Yes.

17:39.190 --> 17:41.140
Master is so cruel.

17:41.900 --> 17:42.540
Yeah.

17:42.560 --> 17:43.790
After all that's happened,

17:43.790 --> 17:44.830
he still insists on Young Lady

17:44.830 --> 17:46.470
getting married in five days as planned.

17:46.470 --> 17:47.620
Yes.

17:50.170 --> 17:51.660
Move the things in.

17:51.880 --> 17:53.410
Don't gossip ever again.

17:53.550 --> 17:56.150
Do you want to end up like Danyan and the others?

17:56.770 --> 17:57.660
Butler Fang.

17:57.680 --> 17:58.440
Should we

17:58.470 --> 17:59.880
burn some joss paper for them

17:59.880 --> 18:00.510
so they can

18:00.510 --> 18:01.510
rest in peace?

18:01.550 --> 18:02.620
I don't want to be haunted.

18:02.620 --> 18:05.100
I told you you were just dreaming.

18:05.800 --> 18:06.790
But I did see…

18:06.790 --> 18:07.790
Don't mention it again!

18:07.790 --> 18:08.400
Yes.

18:08.430 --> 18:09.190
Move it in!

18:30.240 --> 18:31.400
This smell…

18:40.610 --> 18:41.650
Let's go.

18:46.690 --> 18:48.090
Why are you looking at me?

18:48.120 --> 18:49.710
What are you up to this time?

18:52.050 --> 18:53.500
Let me tell you.

18:54.390 --> 18:55.430
I'm going.

19:18.820 --> 19:19.750
Good afternoon.

19:33.100 --> 19:34.540
Are you okay?

19:35.560 --> 19:36.510
I'm fine.

19:38.370 --> 19:40.070
But is he okay?

19:57.270 --> 19:58.860
Why is there another wound?

19:59.330 --> 20:01.190
Isn't it supposed to heal itself?

20:03.030 --> 20:05.760
It's the Demon Slaying Arrow of the Chongwu Camp.

20:06.320 --> 20:09.980
It's laced with a poison specifically designed to target demons.

20:16.080 --> 20:18.380
It keeps the wound from healing

20:19.160 --> 20:20.560
and worsening the ulcer.

20:21.890 --> 20:22.910
It can't be cured.

20:24.560 --> 20:25.580
I can cure it!

20:26.030 --> 20:28.550
[Mortuary]

20:27.290 --> 20:29.980
The Chongwu Camp destroyed all corpses.

20:30.450 --> 20:32.300
Fortunately, I was resourceful

20:32.400 --> 20:34.860
and took a precious body from them.

20:39.430 --> 20:40.270
Sir,

20:40.750 --> 20:42.190
the vanguard squad of the Demon Hunting Bureau

20:42.190 --> 20:44.130
has gone to the crime scene and the mortuary.

20:44.130 --> 20:46.050
They also took a victim's body

20:46.160 --> 20:48.050
from the Chongwu Camp.

20:49.150 --> 20:50.590
Useless idiots.

20:50.920 --> 20:52.020
Leave us.

20:52.180 --> 20:52.970
Yes.

20:55.860 --> 20:57.330
I heard that

20:57.360 --> 20:58.760
over a month ago,

20:59.150 --> 21:02.380
you paid a lot to hire a demon hunter from the Chongwu Camp.

21:03.010 --> 21:04.880
Is that true?

21:09.510 --> 21:10.970
I can't find out anything.

21:16.570 --> 21:18.510
Judging from the bride's expression,

21:18.510 --> 21:20.310
it seems she was scared to death.

21:20.670 --> 21:22.810
That demon scared her to death?

21:22.860 --> 21:24.890
He must look horrifying.

21:35.330 --> 21:36.340
What is this?

21:36.730 --> 21:38.730
The victim is holding it in her hand.

21:38.960 --> 21:40.290
It looks like

21:40.390 --> 21:42.140
a demon's scale.

21:54.520 --> 21:57.290
So that dumbass has run wild.

22:00.630 --> 22:01.760
The case is cracked.

22:02.580 --> 22:03.760
I'm a little hungry.

22:03.870 --> 22:05.270
Let's talk while eating.

22:17.010 --> 22:18.250
Here's the soup.

22:21.950 --> 22:23.160
You've gone too far.

22:23.340 --> 22:25.950
You asked me, a famous physician in Tiandu,

22:25.980 --> 22:27.460
to do an autopsy like a coroner.

22:27.460 --> 22:28.860
That body was so disgusting.

22:28.860 --> 22:31.020
I can't eat for three days after seeing it.

22:31.020 --> 22:31.620
Sir.

22:31.650 --> 22:32.950
Another bowl of lamb soup.

22:32.950 --> 22:33.590
Six pancakes.

22:33.590 --> 22:34.240
A plate of braised pork.

22:34.240 --> 22:34.750
Also,

22:34.750 --> 22:35.960
pack some pepper and vinegar for me.

22:35.960 --> 22:36.550
A lot of pepper.

22:36.550 --> 22:37.350
Okay.

22:41.030 --> 22:42.370
Here, Jiu.

22:43.430 --> 22:44.430
Thank you.

22:48.760 --> 22:49.940
Wait.

22:50.280 --> 22:51.270
Sister Pei,

22:51.430 --> 22:52.460
you're being so nice to me.

22:52.460 --> 22:53.510
Are you going to ask me

22:53.510 --> 22:55.450
to do something scary again?

22:57.350 --> 22:58.280
Well,

22:58.620 --> 23:00.500
Little Bunny has a brain now?

23:05.130 --> 23:06.750
You don't eat anyway.

23:06.770 --> 23:08.950
Tell me about that demon.

23:10.510 --> 23:12.130
The victim has no wounds on her body

23:12.130 --> 23:13.620
but looks terrified.

23:13.710 --> 23:15.840
They were scared to death.

23:16.530 --> 23:17.830
In the Wilderness,

23:18.070 --> 23:19.910
a lot of demons

23:19.940 --> 23:21.060
can scare people to death.

23:21.060 --> 23:22.570
Say something we don't know.

23:22.570 --> 23:23.690
His name is Ran Yi.

23:25.820 --> 23:28.680
You didn't expect me to cut to the point so suddenly?

23:35.310 --> 23:36.230
Ran Yi?

23:38.150 --> 23:40.520
The demon whose flesh is said to be able to

23:40.880 --> 23:41.810
help with sleep?

23:42.210 --> 23:44.810
He was born with the ability to control dreams.

23:45.300 --> 23:47.430
He can indeed make people fall asleep.

23:48.620 --> 23:49.880
He can control dreams?

23:50.570 --> 23:52.070
Can he make me have the dream

23:52.070 --> 23:53.770
of being the best physician every day

23:53.770 --> 23:54.930
and never wake up?

23:55.520 --> 23:58.040
Good dreams are the reflection of our wishes.

23:58.040 --> 23:59.280
They're good,

23:59.430 --> 24:01.110
but they're like the moon in the lake

24:01.110 --> 24:02.690
that disappears when you touch it.

24:02.690 --> 24:04.490
So don't get obsessed with them.

24:06.270 --> 24:07.070
Fine.

24:07.360 --> 24:08.870
But most people

24:09.640 --> 24:11.770
in the world

24:11.920 --> 24:14.510
can never reach the real moon in their whole lives.

24:14.510 --> 24:16.140
For them,

24:17.190 --> 24:18.770
although the moon in the water

24:18.770 --> 24:20.040
is just an illusion,

24:21.070 --> 24:22.530
having it for just a moment

24:22.620 --> 24:24.280
can make them content enough.

24:24.750 --> 24:25.790
However,

24:26.160 --> 24:27.530
some people

24:27.640 --> 24:29.150
never rely on dreams.

24:30.010 --> 24:31.570
They're down-to-earth

24:31.870 --> 24:33.070
and work hard.

24:33.400 --> 24:34.240
For example…

24:34.270 --> 24:35.760
Mr. Zhuo.

24:36.530 --> 24:38.170
He never talks big

24:38.190 --> 24:39.540
and is a man of his word.

24:40.920 --> 24:42.790
Can't you see anyone else

24:42.790 --> 24:44.320
except for your role model?

24:48.010 --> 24:49.270
But it's true that Zhuo

24:49.630 --> 24:51.090
never has dreams.

24:51.220 --> 24:52.050
Really?

24:53.380 --> 24:54.570
That's strange.

24:55.420 --> 24:58.160
I've never heard of anyone who doesn't dream.

24:58.710 --> 25:01.310
Everyone wants to escape from certain things.

25:01.630 --> 25:02.830
At night,

25:02.850 --> 25:04.520
they hide in their dreams

25:05.170 --> 25:06.570
to catch their breath.

25:06.850 --> 25:08.580
That's human nature.

25:12.350 --> 25:13.570
I don't dare to sleep

25:14.920 --> 25:16.100
or dream.

25:17.060 --> 25:18.390
Whenever I fall asleep,

25:18.830 --> 25:20.570
I dream about

25:21.310 --> 25:22.780
becoming a demon.

25:25.790 --> 25:28.100
So Ran Yi is good at

25:28.550 --> 25:30.070
trapping people in dreams

25:30.510 --> 25:31.970
and scaring them to death.

25:32.760 --> 25:34.500
So Ran Yi

25:34.790 --> 25:36.390
gives people bad dreams

25:36.590 --> 25:37.790
instead of good ones?

25:40.070 --> 25:41.910
The record is wrong again.

25:46.700 --> 25:48.800
Then how can we deal with Ran Yi?

25:49.430 --> 25:51.940
You need to either have the Truth Eye

25:53.760 --> 25:54.740
or

25:55.500 --> 25:58.200
cut off a piece of his flesh to eat.

26:02.830 --> 26:05.440
It's better to do it when he's alive.

26:05.980 --> 26:07.640
The flesh can have the best effect that way.

26:07.640 --> 26:09.500
You're the worst, Zhao Yuanzhou.

26:13.150 --> 26:13.940
By the way,

26:14.000 --> 26:16.320
what is the Truth Eye you just mentioned?

26:16.350 --> 26:18.520
Why have I never read about it in books?

26:19.080 --> 26:19.870
It's something

26:19.870 --> 26:22.600
only the greatest demons in the Wilderness have.

26:23.240 --> 26:24.300
Forget about that.

26:24.550 --> 26:25.550
Focus on the case.

26:35.670 --> 26:36.660
Master,

26:37.200 --> 26:39.860
Young Lady's wedding dress and dowry are ready.

26:44.100 --> 26:45.860
Then hurry up and get it done.

26:45.920 --> 26:47.710
Don't miss the auspicious day.

26:48.230 --> 26:49.430
But Master,

26:50.100 --> 26:52.620
what if the Water Ghost comes to take her away?

26:52.620 --> 26:54.910
I spent so much money raising her.

26:55.330 --> 26:57.140
She should be grateful.

26:57.960 --> 26:59.220
Even if she were to die,

26:59.410 --> 27:01.610
she should die on her way to get married.

27:01.650 --> 27:03.540
Once the wedding procession from Duke Zhen's Mansion

27:03.540 --> 27:05.350
takes her away from here,

27:06.280 --> 27:08.570
she has nothing to do with us.

27:09.580 --> 27:11.710
I just want to keep the betrothal gifts

27:11.950 --> 27:14.080
and let my son

27:14.120 --> 27:16.700
marry the daughter of the deputy prefect in style.

27:16.700 --> 27:17.780
But Master,

27:17.830 --> 27:18.820
after all, Young Lady...

27:18.820 --> 27:19.820
Enough!

28:05.640 --> 28:07.540
Now that we know the murderer is Ran Yi,

28:07.540 --> 28:08.980
let's go catch him.

28:09.630 --> 28:11.610
We signed the Military Order.

28:11.640 --> 28:13.840
Our heads are still hanging by a thread.

28:14.190 --> 28:15.930
I don't know where he is.

28:16.090 --> 28:17.220
How can we catch him?

28:17.600 --> 28:18.750
With our minds?

28:19.850 --> 28:21.410
Both of you are demons.

28:21.470 --> 28:23.020
Can't you track his scent?

28:23.180 --> 28:24.980
Dogs track scents.

28:25.010 --> 28:26.050
Even dogs…

28:26.430 --> 28:27.890
are more capable than you.

28:29.690 --> 28:32.390
You said you'd help me find my brother.

28:32.570 --> 28:34.610
Were you just bragging too?

28:38.100 --> 28:39.120
Mr. Zhuo?

28:42.370 --> 28:44.180
I know how to find Ran Yi.

28:44.480 --> 28:46.610
The one who's better than a dog is here.

28:50.270 --> 28:52.470
Miss Qi will get married in five days.

28:52.820 --> 28:54.370
Her wedding date hasn't been delayed.

28:54.370 --> 28:55.700
If we watch over Miss Qi,

28:55.720 --> 28:57.020
we can find Ran Yi.

29:00.060 --> 29:02.060
What's wrong with Master Qi?

29:02.100 --> 29:03.860
Marrying off her daughter now

29:03.880 --> 29:06.410
is sending her to be killed by the Water Ghost.

29:07.610 --> 29:08.530
Mr. Zhuo,

29:08.690 --> 29:10.820
you found something else, didn't you?

29:14.050 --> 29:15.190
Qi's Mansion

29:15.690 --> 29:17.880
is full of a strange smell.

29:21.470 --> 29:22.420
Strange smell?

29:24.660 --> 29:25.680
In the yard,

29:25.930 --> 29:28.460
there's the energy of demon-slaying spells.

29:32.940 --> 29:34.560
It's been eight years.

29:36.890 --> 29:38.530
Zhao Yuanzhou.

29:41.680 --> 29:45.660
Do you still remember your old friend?

29:46.710 --> 29:50.110
You've made so many new friends.

29:51.470 --> 29:54.630
Which one of them should I kill first?

30:03.270 --> 30:05.750
As usual,

30:06.910 --> 30:11.640
I'll start with Baize Goddess.

31:31.270 --> 31:32.070
Show.

31:42.990 --> 31:43.790
Come out.

31:53.640 --> 31:55.410
Stop playing mysterious.

31:56.220 --> 31:57.380
Come to me now,

31:58.440 --> 32:01.150
or I'll set the lake ablaze

32:01.750 --> 32:03.270
and make you a fish soup.

32:36.820 --> 32:37.660
Kneel.

32:42.770 --> 32:45.030
Don't use your little tricks against me.

32:46.050 --> 32:48.330
The illusions you created

32:48.440 --> 32:50.530
can only deceive mortals.

32:51.430 --> 32:53.640
I know you have the Truth Eye.

32:53.660 --> 32:55.490
Of course I can't fool you.

32:59.150 --> 33:02.080
But it's not easy for other demons

33:03.590 --> 33:05.250
to see through the illusions.

33:32.600 --> 33:34.060
Even if you're just a fish,

33:34.840 --> 33:36.770
you still need to treat your wound.

33:50.140 --> 33:51.820
To get you this medicine,

33:52.800 --> 33:56.200
I had to pretend that I was hurt by the Demon Slaying Arrow too.

33:58.490 --> 34:00.270
Why is there another wound?

34:00.680 --> 34:02.830
That was so disgraceful for me.

34:06.680 --> 34:08.420
When will you

34:09.280 --> 34:10.810
fulfill your promise to me?

34:15.230 --> 34:16.250
Don't worry.

34:19.969 --> 34:20.810
Soon.

34:22.790 --> 34:23.610
Master.

34:23.639 --> 34:27.040
Some officers from the Demon Hunting Bureau asked to see you.

34:27.850 --> 34:29.449
They're quick.

34:29.780 --> 34:31.550
You know what to do, don't you?

34:31.790 --> 34:32.590
Yes.

34:33.350 --> 34:34.469
I'll go meet them.

34:34.820 --> 34:36.260
Walk the general out

34:36.310 --> 34:37.570
through the back door.

34:37.800 --> 34:38.590
Lead the way.

34:39.280 --> 34:40.070
Please.

34:50.110 --> 34:50.909
Please.

35:18.080 --> 35:18.950
Lead the way.

35:21.110 --> 35:22.030
Coming.

35:33.390 --> 35:35.080
[Wedding Letter]

35:36.950 --> 35:38.070
Officers,

35:38.520 --> 35:41.050
this is the wedding letter left by the Water Ghost.

35:41.050 --> 35:42.070
See if you can

35:42.240 --> 35:44.040
find anything special about it.

35:44.900 --> 35:45.830
Wedding letter?

35:58.150 --> 35:59.230
Where is Miss Qi?

36:00.650 --> 36:02.320
She…

36:02.860 --> 36:03.710
My daughter

36:03.710 --> 36:04.950
was too frightened

36:04.950 --> 36:05.990
and caught a cold.

36:06.130 --> 36:08.080
She has been bedridden for days

36:08.110 --> 36:09.690
and can't see any visitors.

36:20.830 --> 36:22.230
There's demonic energy.

36:22.760 --> 36:24.420
Some demon is lurking around.

36:24.870 --> 36:26.000
The wedding letter

36:26.020 --> 36:27.970
has strong demonic energy left on it.

36:27.970 --> 36:29.270
Mr. Qi,

36:29.750 --> 36:30.990
have you set up a formation

36:30.990 --> 36:33.160
in your mansion to kill demons?

36:33.810 --> 36:35.280
To be honest, officers,

36:35.750 --> 36:37.630
the whole household is in a panic.

36:37.660 --> 36:38.270
So

36:38.330 --> 36:40.240
I asked someone to set up a formation

36:40.240 --> 36:41.630
to calm them down.

36:42.720 --> 36:44.760
Before the Water Ghost case,

36:45.280 --> 36:47.330
was there anything unusual in the mansion?

36:47.330 --> 36:48.730
We lived a peaceful life.

36:49.230 --> 36:50.640
Nothing unusual.

36:52.370 --> 36:53.670
Mr. Qi.

36:54.310 --> 36:56.360
If you really want to save your daughter,

36:56.360 --> 36:58.620
you need to be honest with us

36:58.650 --> 36:59.780
and hide no secrets.

36:59.800 --> 37:00.600
Of course.

37:01.720 --> 37:03.020
Please

37:03.250 --> 37:04.860
save my daughter.

37:08.500 --> 37:09.450
[God of Happiness]

37:15.230 --> 37:17.160
Something's wrong with Master Qi.

37:18.390 --> 37:19.610
The case file doesn't mention

37:19.610 --> 37:22.580
anything about the wedding letter from the Water Ghost.

37:22.580 --> 37:23.380
No.

37:23.930 --> 37:25.620
Only Miss Qi received it.

37:26.220 --> 37:27.780
It seems that Miss Qi

37:27.810 --> 37:30.140
is the key to solving the Water Ghost case.

37:31.340 --> 37:33.350
But we can't see her.

37:36.920 --> 37:37.520
Hey.

37:38.230 --> 37:40.520
The Qi family is really unlucky.

37:40.550 --> 37:42.930
It was supposed to be great that Miss Qi was getting married,

37:42.930 --> 37:44.850
but such a misfortune befell her.

37:44.880 --> 37:45.690
Exactly.

37:45.710 --> 37:46.790
Over the past month,

37:46.790 --> 37:47.910
a lot of things happened in the mansion.

37:47.910 --> 37:49.350
No one knows why.

37:49.970 --> 37:51.100
Over the past month?

37:52.240 --> 37:53.980
What happened before?

37:54.780 --> 37:55.950
Nothing.

37:55.980 --> 37:57.340
I know nothing.

38:00.660 --> 38:03.430
I-I really don't know.

38:03.470 --> 38:05.910
He has a bad temper,

38:05.940 --> 38:07.390
not easy to deal with.

38:08.830 --> 38:10.990
I-I really don't know.

38:11.860 --> 38:12.610
Tell us.

38:14.760 --> 38:15.470
I only know

38:15.470 --> 38:17.070
a month ago, Master secretly

38:17.070 --> 38:19.090
hired a demon hunter from the Chongwu Camp

38:19.090 --> 38:20.940
and forbade us from telling anyone about it.

38:20.940 --> 38:21.500
As for

38:21.520 --> 38:22.410
the reason,

38:22.440 --> 38:23.880
I-I really don't know.

38:24.080 --> 38:24.940
Anything else?

38:24.940 --> 38:25.890
No.

38:25.920 --> 38:27.630
That's all I know.

38:28.220 --> 38:29.750
As early as over a month ago,

38:29.750 --> 38:31.880
Master Qi hired a demon hunter.

38:33.470 --> 38:34.590
But Ran Yi's wedding letter

38:34.590 --> 38:35.620
has just arrived.

38:39.030 --> 38:39.980
Do you know

38:40.090 --> 38:41.550
where the demon hunter is?

38:43.640 --> 38:44.520
I know.

39:02.870 --> 39:03.840
Master.

39:04.230 --> 39:05.760
As you ordered,

39:05.960 --> 39:07.260
I've told them

39:07.290 --> 39:08.960
that you hired a demon hunter

39:08.990 --> 39:10.350
over a month ago.

39:10.780 --> 39:12.030
Did you tell them

39:12.270 --> 39:13.830
where the demon hunter is?

39:14.110 --> 39:14.790
I did.

39:14.800 --> 39:16.060
If nothing happens,

39:16.120 --> 39:17.610
they should have set off.

39:29.550 --> 39:29.990
Hey.

39:30.030 --> 39:30.720
Great Demon.

39:30.720 --> 39:32.920
Why isn't there any task assigned to me?

39:33.480 --> 39:34.540
Of course there is.

39:35.090 --> 39:37.010
Your task is to stay away from the battlefield.

39:37.010 --> 39:38.540
Don't cause us any trouble.

39:39.540 --> 39:41.210
Why aren't you catching the demon?

39:41.210 --> 39:43.580
You let Brother Zhuo and Sister Pei do all the work

39:43.580 --> 39:45.110
while you idle around here.

39:46.560 --> 39:48.820
Why are you scolding Wen Xiao so harshly?

39:50.510 --> 39:51.240
I…

39:54.310 --> 39:55.280
Wen.

39:55.310 --> 39:56.630
He's trying to sow discord between us.

39:56.630 --> 39:57.810
Don't fall for it.

39:59.610 --> 40:01.020
We're waiting,

40:01.050 --> 40:02.340
not idling around.

40:02.540 --> 40:04.610
If the demon tries to escape,

40:04.630 --> 40:06.350
this is his only way out.

40:06.580 --> 40:08.740
We just need to wait for him to show up.

40:09.100 --> 40:09.580
Okay.

40:10.740 --> 40:11.450
Humph!

40:24.030 --> 40:25.510
Do the demons in the Wilderness

40:25.510 --> 40:26.710
only drink water

40:26.710 --> 40:27.990
and not eat?

40:29.250 --> 40:31.110
We don't even have to drink water.

40:39.060 --> 40:40.390
Low-maintenance pets.

40:41.080 --> 40:42.840
Then do you want to have one?

40:43.560 --> 40:45.030
Since I was young,

40:45.070 --> 40:46.470
every pet I kept has died.

40:47.460 --> 40:48.950
That's very tempting.

40:55.110 --> 40:57.060
Since you don't need water,

40:57.080 --> 40:59.180
why are you always holding a bottle?

41:02.260 --> 41:03.860
It serves a special purpose?

41:06.520 --> 41:07.520
Zhao Yuanzhou.

41:07.640 --> 41:08.710
I've always suspected

41:08.710 --> 41:10.370
what's in your bottle is wine,

41:10.530 --> 41:12.190
but I have no evidence.

41:13.410 --> 41:14.660
It's indeed water.

41:14.840 --> 41:16.400
I simply like drinking water.

41:16.400 --> 41:17.510
Just like some tree demons

41:17.510 --> 41:19.280
like sunbathing.

41:19.670 --> 41:21.180
What kind of water is it?

41:23.560 --> 41:25.490
You want to get something out of me?

41:26.410 --> 41:27.430
As your colleague,

41:27.430 --> 41:29.750
I just want to know more about you.

41:30.200 --> 41:32.460
I advise you not to.

41:34.240 --> 41:34.990
Why?

41:36.420 --> 41:38.340
Because the more you know about me,

41:38.340 --> 41:39.100
the more…

41:39.550 --> 41:40.720
Dangerous!

41:42.220 --> 41:44.320
Run, run!

41:54.820 --> 41:56.880
If you want to catch up,

41:58.760 --> 42:00.070
come with me.

42:03.260 --> 42:04.230
Wen Xiao!

42:04.620 --> 42:05.420
Stay hidden!

42:42.020 --> 42:43.350
What are you doing here?

42:47.560 --> 42:49.210
He'd have run away if I hadn't come.

42:49.210 --> 42:50.970
Do you think I'll let him run away?

42:50.970 --> 42:52.490
Open your eyes.

42:53.410 --> 42:54.270
Don't kill him!

43:27.360 --> 43:28.410
Li Lun.

43:29.840 --> 43:32.170
You're playing that parasite game again.

43:32.460 --> 43:34.150
You're not used to not having

43:35.280 --> 43:37.110
your Truth Eye, are you?

43:39.550 --> 43:40.800
Li Lun?

43:45.200 --> 43:47.680
Li Lun, who killed my master.

43:52.870 --> 43:53.530
Li Lun,

43:53.700 --> 43:54.770
do you admit your crimes?

43:54.770 --> 43:56.120
Zhao Wan'er,

43:56.660 --> 43:59.080
you're just a mortal.

43:59.750 --> 44:02.600
Who are you to interfere in the affairs of the Wilderness?

44:02.600 --> 44:04.500
I'm from the Baize bloodline,

44:05.410 --> 44:07.740
so it's my duty to protect the Wilderness.

44:07.790 --> 44:09.010
Of course I have to intervene.

44:09.010 --> 44:10.950
Then I'll kill you.

44:11.510 --> 44:13.570
Let's see how you can intervene then.

44:14.940 --> 44:15.850
Master!

44:23.390 --> 44:24.460
Master!

44:29.350 --> 44:30.370
Master.

44:32.400 --> 44:33.520
Master!

44:52.380 --> 44:54.310
She's close to remembering it.

44:56.010 --> 44:57.100
How about

44:58.770 --> 44:59.860
I help her?

45:47.230 --> 45:48.300
Wen Xiao!

45:52.270 --> 45:53.190
How about now?

45:54.630 --> 45:56.680
Do you remember everything?
